/S /P
/E (The EA10 Ventus Attack 12K XTREM, designed in collaboration with Edu Alonso, is designed for players looking to dominate the attacking game and make every shot count. It features the new mould from the 2026 Luxury racket collection, which improves aerodynamics and overall performance. Its diamond shape, longer grip and high attacking balance allow for powerful shots while maintaining the precision needed to control the decisive moments of the match. The combination of 12K Xtrem carbon on the faces and the MLD Black Eva core guarantees a firm feel, excellent ball rebound and stability even during the most demanding rallies.)
/Pg 20 0 R
